      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEDERAL SCAMMER (2) is a Leeanne Goodwin-trained newcomer by Shima Shine out of Fancy Kelly. Drawn favourably and can capitalise. Profiles strongly and pay to watch the market closely. JAMIE (5) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (23.75) last time in a Maiden at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Can do much better this time. SAYS WHO (6) has hit the frame in both career runs, the latest when second (17.66) over 300m at Taree Super Track. Expecting another bold showing. JUST A GLANCE (1) is building a nice sequence of placings – demands consideration.",
